            "notes": "**PURCHASES**\nBuy Aim to get either [Eye of the Spider](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) or [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) to increase your burst damage in flight. Weapon jammer also gives an increase in survivablity in 1v1s and you can apply the debuff to multiple people with your visor powers. \n\n**OPTIONAL ITEMS**\n[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) is a solid choice if you need to focus high armour targets like [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a) or [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85) more.\n[Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) can also be a good buy when playing into [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da) or [Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9).\n[Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) can also be worthwhile if you're against an [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)[Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) or someone using [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) since by now they would have had some powerspikes.",
